      "start_ms": 693870,
      "end_ms": 695070,
      "text": "太难搞了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 274,
      "start_ms": 695070,
      "end_ms": 696510,
      "text": "我靠我服了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 275,
      "start_ms": 696510,
      "end_ms": 698910,
      "text": "为什么规定是两个自然人要跟我要"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 276,
      "start_ms": 698910,
      "end_ms": 699810,
      "text": "三个自然人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 277,
      "start_ms": 699810,
      "end_ms": 700880,
      "text": "凭什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 278,
      "start_ms": 703460,
      "end_ms": 705700,
      "text": "这是公益这个名字为什么有问题啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 279,
      "start_ms": 711520,
      "end_ms": 712840,
      "text": "嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 280,
      "start_ms": 712840,
      "end_ms": 717360,
      "text": "那你的阶级基础不是工人群众吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 281,
      "start_ms": 717360,
      "end_ms": 720300,
      "text": "我不希望这句话是真是一个反问句啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 282,
      "start_ms": 720300,
      "end_ms": 723150,
      "text": "到底这句这句话是个疑问句还是反问句"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 283,
      "start_ms": 723150,
      "end_ms": 726380,
      "text": "是由你们决定的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 284,
      "start_ms": 728660,
      "end_ms": 731290,
      "text": "唉当时所有东西我都懂了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 285,
      "start_ms": 731290,
      "end_ms": 734680,
      "text": "我只是说你们都是聪明人啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 286,
      "start_ms": 734680,
      "end_ms": 735940,
      "text": "都是聪明人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 287,
      "start_ms": 735940,
      "end_ms": 737640,
      "text": "所有人都是聪明人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 288,
      "start_ms": 738160,
      "end_ms": 739300,
      "text": "都知道"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 289,
      "start_ms": 739300,
      "end_ms": 741820,
      "text": "都他妈老老甲鱼老江湖了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 290,
      "start_ms": 741820,
      "end_ms": 743439,
      "text": "不知道这些猫腻吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 291,
      "start_ms": 744100,
      "end_ms": 746310,
      "text": "天天叫一两个人盯着看"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 292,
      "start_ms": 746310,
      "end_ms": 747960,
      "text": "拿实事求着你们来这一套"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 293,
      "start_ms": 747960,
      "end_ms": 748560,
      "text": "我也没办法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 294,
      "start_ms": 748560,
      "end_ms": 750770,
      "text": "我只能那只能说啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 295,
      "start_ms": 750770,
      "end_ms": 752060,
      "text": "法人民以公司名义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 296,
      "start_ms": 752060,
      "end_ms": 753620,
      "text": "反正同样的你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 297,
      "start_ms": 753620,
      "end_ms": 757740,
      "text": "你但凡你有个法人名义里面的成员都是大"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 298,
      "start_ms": 757740,
      "end_ms": 758940,
      "text": "他者都知道你是谁了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 299,
      "start_ms": 760620,
      "end_ms": 761550,
      "text": "你不这样的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 300,
      "start_ms": 761550,
      "end_ms": 763219,
      "text": "你做不了任何事的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 301,
      "start_ms": 763940,
      "end_ms": 766000,
      "text": "你学生问题不大的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 302,
      "start_ms": 766000,
      "end_ms": 767760,
      "text": "你毕业了是个白领"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 303,
      "start_ms": 769460,
      "end_ms": 770920,
      "text": "你没有个法人名义的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 304,
      "start_ms": 770920,
      "end_ms": 772480,
      "text": "你很多事情做不了的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 305,
      "start_ms": 772480,
      "end_ms": 775040,
      "text": "you can't do most of things"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 306,
      "start_ms": 775040,
      "end_ms": 777140,
      "text": "好多事情做不了了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 307,
      "start_ms": 777140,
      "end_ms": 779840,
      "text": "法律命令的话比较简单的就是说你要发食物"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 308,
      "start_ms": 779840,
      "end_ms": 781040,
      "text": "那你如果是个餐饮店"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 309,
      "start_ms": 781040,
      "end_ms": 783359,
      "text": "你就更你如果是个餐饮店"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 310,
      "start_ms": 783800,
      "end_ms": 786320,
      "text": "或者说你是一个什么啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 311,
      "start_ms": 786320,
      "end_ms": 789080,
      "text": "个体户啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 312,
      "start_ms": 789080,
      "end_ms": 790880,
      "text": "做做餐饮的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 313,
      "start_ms": 790880,
      "end_ms": 795760,
      "text": "就甚至留个早早餐车在派出所登记过"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 314,
      "start_ms": 795880,
      "end_ms": 798280,
      "text": "在接到报卫国啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 315,
      "start_ms": 798280,
      "end_ms": 799660,
      "text": "反正你有个法人名义啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 316,
      "start_ms": 799660,
      "end_ms": 800860,
      "text": "个体户的名义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 317,
      "start_ms": 800860,
      "end_ms": 803020,
      "text": "你去做这些事情更好做"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 318,
      "start_ms": 803100,
      "end_ms": 806690,
      "text": "easily easier to do this kind of trainer"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 319,
      "start_ms": 806690,
      "end_ms": 808550,
      "text": "当然我不是说一定要做餐饮的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 320,
      "start_ms": 808550,
      "end_ms": 811610,
      "text": "你还可以有其他的服务性的一些活动啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 321,
      "start_ms": 811610,
      "end_ms": 815849,
      "text": "这个过程呢就是说你把就业和工艺结合起来吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 322,
      "start_ms": 815849,
      "end_ms": 819780,
      "text": "工工艺和就业结合起来啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 323,
      "start_ms": 820880,
      "end_ms": 821860,
      "text": "你想办法吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 324,
      "start_ms": 821860,
      "end_ms": 824440,
      "text": "我说很多人其实你们也是在这样想了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 325,
      "start_ms": 824440,
      "end_ms": 826060,
      "text": "也是在这样这样去探索"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 326,
      "start_ms": 826060,
      "end_ms": 827140,
      "text": "在摸索了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 327,
      "start_ms": 828540,
      "end_ms": 830000,
      "text": "那我实事求是讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 328,
      "start_ms": 830000,
      "end_ms": 832040,
      "text": "就这么个意思啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 329,
      "start_ms": 832040,
      "end_ms": 835780,
      "text": "如果说一定要要有这个资金往来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 330,
      "start_ms": 835780,
      "end_ms": 836920,
      "text": "你不是个公益机构"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 331,
      "start_ms": 836920,
      "end_ms": 838060,
      "text": "我没有办法给你住"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 332,
      "start_ms": 838060,
      "end_ms": 839680,
      "text": "我没法给你给你捐款"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 333,
      "start_ms": 839680,
      "end_ms": 840640,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 334,
      "start_ms": 840820,
      "end_ms": 841840,
      "text": "我直接给你钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 335,
      "start_ms": 841840,
      "end_ms": 843580,
      "text": "那又算什么呢啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 336,
      "start_ms": 843580,
      "end_ms": 845920,
      "text": "所以说这个就是一个动态啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 337,
      "start_ms": 845920,
      "end_ms": 848810,
      "text": "给你们讲一下这么这么一个状态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 338,
      "start_ms": 848810,
      "end_ms": 851630,
      "text": "我们不是不我们不是说我们不想注册公益机构"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 339,
      "start_ms": 851630,
      "end_ms": 852950,
      "text": "我们在拼命的注册哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 340,
      "start_ms": 852950,
      "end_ms": 854510,
      "text": "我们有个人天天在跑去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 341,
      "start_ms": 854510,
      "end_ms": 858560,
      "text": "你那个那个去多少次了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 342,
      "start_ms": 859660,
      "end_ms": 860880,
      "text": "出多少次了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 343,
      "start_ms": 860880,
      "end_ms": 862500,
      "text": "这个东西有我们诚意"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 344,
      "start_ms": 862500,
      "end_ms": 863880,
      "text": "已经拉满了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 345,
      "start_ms": 863880,
      "end_ms": 865230,
      "text": "拉满了好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 346,
      "start_ms": 865230,
      "end_ms": 865960,
      "text": "那就讲到这里"
    }
